type: software
title: "Ski-Lift Pass Gates CLI built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "A command-line tool for ski-lift turnstiles: passes and gate scans as Pixeltable tables with a computed gate verdict, a per-zone view built with list_iterator, OpenTelemetry span traces of every command, and the same commands against a Pixeltable Cloud database."
